Package: znorm
Type: Package
Title: Box-Cox Standardization of Laboratory Measurements
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Sandra", "Klawitter", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                     email = "sandra.klawitter@trillium.de"),
                     person("Georg", "Hoffmann", role = "aut"),
                     person("Frank", "Klawonn", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Sandra Klawitter <sandra.klawitter@trillium.de>
Description: Standardizes positive laboratory measurements relative to
    reference limits using a Box-Cox transformation with a supplied power
    parameter. Provides the inverse transformation and supports reference
    limits and power parameters specific to each measurement. Extends the
    zlog approach of Hoffmann et al. (2017)
    <doi:10.1515/labmed-2016-0087> using the transformation of
    Box and Cox (1964) <doi:10.1111/j.2517-6161.1964.tb00553.x>.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
